# FileWisely — Cursor agent boundaries (filewisely repo)
# Copy to repo root as `.cursorrules` after cloning filewisely.git

Production backend + Lovable portal. **Not** the UCE Sidekick desktop app (that is https://github.com/jeffatkins-filewisely/uce).

## Default lane: server + contracts

**Allowed:**

- `supabase/functions/**`
- `supabase/migrations/**`
- `_shared/**` (contracts, helpers)
- `backend/contracts/**` (if present)
- `scripts/**` (ops/deploy)

**Forbidden** unless the user explicitly requests portal UI:

- `src/pages/**`, `src/components/**`, `src/integrations/**` — Lovable UI; do not redesign
- Design system, auto-generated Lovable files the user did not name

## Portal UI lane

Only when the user explicitly names files under `src/pages` or `src/components`.

## Sidekick / desktop

Do **not** edit Tauri or Sidekick code here — that lives in the **uce** repo. Desktop contract mirrors in **uce** are updated via sync after edge changes.

